+- Each point carries `data_origin` from the source registry (D8). A NULL `source` column is omitted from the point (contract: optional) and its origin is `UNKNOWN`, never invented; the generated OpenAPI also lists `source` as optional (a test compares `required` exactly, because the generic conformance check is only a subset check). `meta.contains_sample_data` is true only when a shown point is `SAMPLE_FIXTURE`.
